  <item>
    <title>EP30. 复读那一年那些事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/689771f8032793b18a90561a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">689771f8032793b18a90561a</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 11 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家都说</span><strong><span>高考</span></strong><span>是千军万马过独木桥，</span></p><span></span><p><span>而高三是很多人一生中 最压缩又最焦虑的一年。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但你有没有想过：如果高考失利了 这一年可以重新来过，会怎么样？</span></p><span></span><p><span>你还记得你知道自己高考成绩那一刻的心情吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>你身边有复读过的朋友吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>正值高考结束，我们今天请到一位嘉宾，轩哥！</span></p><span></span><p><span>一起聊聊我们高中趣事和他</span><strong><span>高四复读的那一年，那些事</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="283">04:43</a> 河北省的211在天津市？！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="429">07:09</a> 轩哥为什么复读？ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2347">39:07</a> 怎么高考还提前开香槟啊？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="805">13:25</a> 语文作文考8分！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1184">19:44</a> 摆烂心态养成</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1665">27:45</a> CC被喊家长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1806">30:06</a> 整蛊老师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2275">37:55</a> 别人的期待是枷锁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3076">51:16</a> 原生家庭的包容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3677">01:01:17</a> 小孩暑假打打工，人生选择提前知&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期嘉宾】轩哥</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】CC / KK / 飘飘</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音频剪辑】CC / KK / 飘飘</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】Ágætis byrjun -- Sigur Rós</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你觉得我们可回收有点意思，欢迎订阅我们，</span></p><span></span><p><span>搜索“可回收站台” 我们在</span><strong><span>小宇宙</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>网易云音乐</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>喜马拉雅</span></strong><span>同步推送~</span></p><span></span><p><span>你的支持将会成为我们持续更新的动力，</span></p><span></span><p><span>同时也希望我们站台能给你们带来一点可回收的东西，</span></p><span></span><p><span>谢谢~</span></p>]]></description>
